    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated within the highly desirable Brooklawn residential development on Castlerea Road, \n\nThis well-presented two-bedroom apartment enjoys a prime location within walking distance of Ballaghaderreen town centre and its excellent range of amenities, including shops, restaurants, schools, churches, and sporting facilities.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of:\nspacious open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area featuring a combination of timber and tiled flooring, with a patio door opening onto a private balcony. \nThere are two generously sized bedrooms, both with timber flooring, and a fully tiled family bathroom.\nThe property is connected to mains water and mains sewerage services.\n\nThis apartment offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a low-maintenance home in a convenient location.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is by appointment only.\n"
      },
